                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b58688d-d8b0-3e89-b153-21241eb92e9b",
                        "entry_id": "c7358d7c-dc4c-37a7-a42c-4487b20e4eea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to fade"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "659d88c3-13cf-46f9-ba47-3d0ba4fe0143",
                                "sense_id": "9b58688d-d8b0-3e89-b153-21241eb92e9b",
                                "text": "Но гла́вное, что угнета́ло меня́, — я ви́дел, чу́вствовал, как тяжело́ ма́тери жить в до́ме де́да; она́ всё бо́лее хму́рилась, смотре́ла на всех чужи́ми глаза́ми, она́ подо́лгу мо́лча сиде́ла у окна́ в сад и ка́к-то выцвета́ла вся.",
                                "translation": "But what oppressed me more than anything else was seeing my mother suffering so much in Grandfather’s house. Her face had become a perpetual frown and she looked at everyone with the eyes of a stranger, sitting silently by the window for hours on end; she seemed to be completely fading away.",
                                "english": "But what oppressed me more than anything else was seeing my mother suffering so much in Grandfather’s house. Her face had become a perpetual frown and she looked at everyone with the eyes of a stranger, sitting silently by the window for hours on end; she seemed to be completely fading away."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7d9548b-033c-427c-9e8b-8d54cf7cdca6",
                                "sense_id": "9b58688d-d8b0-3e89-b153-21241eb92e9b",
                                "text": "Выцвета́ет плёнка под уда́рами луче́й"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
